      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 1. Entrada\nPOST com JSON:\n```\n{\n  \"servidor\": \"SRV-CFTV-02\",\n  \"cpu\": 72,\n  \"memoria\": 84,\n  \"disco\": 93,\n  \"servico\": \"online\"\n}\n```\nO payload chega em `$json.body`.",
